{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>11月9日，英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳的私人醜聞引發市場劇烈反應，公司股價盤中一度下跌8.8%，按此前約4.5萬億美元的市值計算，市值最大縮水約3960億美元，已經創下上市公司因高管個人醜聞引發的最大單日市值損失紀錄。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/tech/transform/104/w550h354/20261109/b400-83ea115abaab02544c706d0eb8496095.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>這一規模遠超2025年6月特斯拉行政總裁馬斯克與美國總統特朗普公開決裂時，特斯拉股價單日下跌14.3%、市值蒸發約1500億美元的損失規模。</p>\n<p>與此同時，黃仁勳個人持股價值也一度縮水約143億美元。</p>\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/tech/transform/104/w550h354/20261109/b400-83ea115abaab02544c706d0eb8496095.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:48.172684+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":2,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T15:26:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T15:56:23.688541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:23.600690+00:00","content_hash":"d3c20e6f18ca22deff354b1ba25274cd9912cb7e1790b6cc5c79c074e424709a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:48.172684+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}